Quotes and owners

`Edge: CDN` sends to the `Web app`, with the label `serve`. The `Web app` calls
`API, v1`. The team `Platform` owns `Edge: CDN`, and the team `Apps` owns the
`Web app` and `API, v1`. Use the key `owner`.
---
"Edge: CDN" -> Web app: serve
Web app -> "API, v1"
"Edge: CDN" { owner: Platform }
Web app, "API, v1" { owner: Apps }
